{"version": 2, "width": 120, "height": 36, "timestamp": 1793214914, "env": {"SHELL": null, "TERM": null}, "title": "PR #702 before/after - hostile git config"}
[0.173958, "o", "\u001b[H\u001b[2J\u001b[3JPR #702 - test(ingest): isolate git-resolver tests from host git config (fixes #614)\r\n\r\nHostile host git config, injected via environment (same effect as a\r\nurl.insteadof rewrite in a developer's ~/.gitconfig):\r\n  GIT_CONFIG_COUNT=1\r\n  GIT_CONFIG_KEY_0=url.https://github.com/.insteadof\r\n  GIT_CONFIG_VALUE_0=git@github.com:\r\n=> git remote get-url rewrites git@github.com:testuser/testrepo.git\r\n   to https://github.com/testuser/testrepo.git\r\n"]
[2.235202, "o", "\r\n########## BEFORE: develop (be2bc57) - no TestMain isolation ##########\r\n"]
[3.067411, "o", "\u001b[33mbe2bc57\u001b[m\u001b[33m (\u001b[m\u001b[1;36mHEAD\u001b[m\u001b[33m, \u001b[m\u001b[1;33mtag: \u001b[m\u001b[1;33mv0.13.4\u001b[m\u001b[33m, \u001b[m\u001b[1;31morigin/develop\u001b[m\u001b[33m, \u001b[m\u001b[1;31morigin/HEAD\u001b[m\u001b[33m, \u001b[m\u001b[1;32mdevelop\u001b[m\u001b[33m)\u001b[m release(v0.13.4): restore canonical transcript host and recorded PR evidence (#774)\r\n"]
[635.807564, "o", "--- FAIL: TestExecGitResolver_RemoteURL (1.03s)\r\n    git_test.go:307: RemoteURL = \"https://github.com/testuser/testrepo.git\", want \"git@github.com:testuser/testrepo.git\"\r\n--- FAIL: TestExecGitResolver_WalkUpRemoteURL_FirstHop (0.86s)\r\n    git_test.go:484: remote = \"https://github.com/testuser/testrepo.git\", want \"git@github.com:testuser/testrepo.git\"\r\n--- FAIL: TestExecGitResolver_WalkUpRemoteURL_NthHop (0.97s)\r\n    git_test.go:510: remote = \"https://github.com/testuser/testrepo.git\", want \"git@github.com:testuser/testrepo.git\"\r\n--- FAIL: TestExecGitResolver_WalkUpRemoteURL_StopsAtRepositoryBoundary (2.58s)\r\n    git_test.go:581: WalkUpRemoteURL(/home/hatch/workspace/tools/tmp/TestExecGitResolver_WalkUpRemoteURL_StopsAtRepositoryBoundary406139083/001) = \"https://github.com/testuser/testrepo.git\", want \"git@github.com:testuser/testrepo.git\"\r\n    git_test.go:581: WalkUpRemoteURL(/home/hatch/workspace/tools/tmp/TestExecGitResolver_WalkUpRemoteURL_StopsAtRepositoryBoundary406139083/001/a/b) = \"https://github.com/testuser/testrepo.git\", want \"git@github.com:testuser/testrepo.git\"\r\n--- FAIL: TestResolveGitRemoteAttribution (5.64s)\r\n    --- FAIL: TestResolveGitRemoteAttribution/checkout_falls_back_to_origin (0.83s)\r\n        git_attribution_test.go:70: got (\"https://github.com/testuser/testrepo.git\", \"\"), want (\"git@github.com:testuser/testrepo.git\", \"\")\r\n    --- FAIL: TestResolveGitRemoteAttribution/recorded_untracked_branch_ignores_checkout_upstream (1.03s)\r\n        git_attribution_test.go:70: got (\"https://github.com/testuser/testrepo.git\", \"\"), want (\"git@github.com:testuser/testrepo.git\", \"\")\r\n    --- FAIL: TestResolveGitRemoteAttribution/local_recorded_upstream_falls_back_to_origin (0.81s)\r\n        git_attribution_test.go:70: got (\"https://github.com/testuser/testrepo.git\", \"\"), want (\"git@github.com:testuser/testrepo.git\", \"\")\r\nFAIL\r\nFAIL\tgithub.com/peasant-labs/peasant/internal/ingest\t17.627s\r\nFAIL\r\n"]
